        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513953385835_134274_61547"/>
        <body>An Analysis is the process of studying or examining something in an organized way to learn more about it, or a specific study or examination of something. &lt;note&gt; The full range of the Analysis process includes mathematical, physical testing, cognitive, chemical, etc.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>Analysis</name>
      <ownedAttribute xmi:id="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513953386459_62058_61593" xmi:uuid="a11a1708-9c2a-4785-9813-8e945fa53649" xmi:type="uml:Property">
