          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_8e001ed_1513953387038_186029_61804"/>
          <body> the identifier or set of identifiers for the AnalysisDisciplineDefinition. The value of this attribute need not be specified. &lt;note&gt;This attribute supports multi-identification in different contexts as described in Fundamental concepts and assumptions.&lt;/note&gt;</body>
        </ownedComment>
